# BNAB — Agent Rules

- Use semantic theme tokens (`bg-canvas`, `bg-surface`, `text-fg`, `bg-accent`, …) — never hardcoded zinc/emerald/white.
- Amounts are integer **minor units** (bani); format via `formatMoney` / parse via `parseMoneyInput`.
- Envelope Available is **derived** by `lib/budget-engine` — do not persist Available.
- Financial accounts are `FinanceAccount` (Auth.js owns model `Account`).
- Prefer mobile-first layouts: bottom tabs, large touch targets, sticky Ready to Assign.
- Keep docs in `bnab/docs/` in sync when changing engine math or deploy paths.
